  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.<br>• Cook egg noodles over medium-high heat, stirring occasionally with a fork to separate, until tender, 4-5 mins.<br>• Drain, rinse and drizzle with olive oil to prevent sticking. Cover to keep warm. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2032692e6f55eab0d5e6/step-7c5b8900.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat.<br>• Fry the eggs until cooked to your liking, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a plate. Season with salt and pepper. Cover to keep warm.<br>• While eggs are frying, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• In a small bowl, combine Asian BBQ seasoning, sweet chilli sauce and the soy sauce, vinegar and water.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2032692e6f55eab0d5e6/step-6dc8ce10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook sliced mushrooms until slightly softened, 2-3 mins.<br>• Add carrot and zucchini and stir-fry until tender, 4-5 mins.<br>• Reduce heat to medium, add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.<br>• Add cooked egg noodles and Asian BBQ sauce mixture, tossing, until well combined, 1 min. Season with pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2032692e6f55eab0d5e6/step-9164c220.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide mushroom noodle stir-fry between bowls. <br>• Top with a fried egg and crispy shallots to serve.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69cb2032692e6f55eab0d5e6/step-373d6030.jpeg"
    }
  ]
